RD ALFA Microelectronics has 50 years of experience designing and producing HiRel, RadHard & ITAR free for EU, analogue Integrated Circuits (ICs) for aerospace and industrial, including automotive and special purpose microcircuits. Initially founded in 1962, the company is a pioneer in electronics and has regularly participated in European Space Agency (ESA) projects since 2015. RD ALFA Microelectronics Quality Management System (QMS) conforms to the requirements of the International Standard ISO 9001:2015 (confirmed by the Certificate CV20/0092, SGS (Société Générale de Surveillance, Zurich).
 TECHNOLOGIES AND COMPETENCES
 Factory specialists have expertise in analog and analog-to-digital technology (Bi-polar (Bi), Bi-FET, complementary Bi, CMOS, and Bi-CMOS) as well as the design and testing of microcircuits. RD ALFA Microelectronics has developed Quad Operational Amplifier aRD124A that successfully qualified for usage in ESA space missions. 
PRODUCTS AND SERVICES IN SPACE 
• MIL-STD 1553, monolithic dual transceivers; 
• Operational Amplifiers; 
• Comparators; 
• Analog Switch; 
• Transistor Pair. 
EQUIPMENT

• Assembly equipment of the Integrated Circuits in nitrogen atmosphere according to ESCC 9000;

• Testing equipment of the Integrated Circuits according to ESCC 9000. 

MAJOR SPACE PROJECTS AND ACHIEVEMENTS 
• ESA-PECS, Research and Identification of ICs for application in ESA missions, year 2015; 
• ESA-PECS, Development of QUAD Operational Amplifier IC aRD124A, year 2016; 
• ESA-PECS, Development of QUAD Comparator IC aRD139A, year 2018; 
• ESA-PECS, Qualification of QUAD Operational Amplifier IC aRD124A for use in ESA space applications, year 2019. 
CURRENT AND TARGET PARTNERSHIP 
• RD ALFA Microelectronics works closely with such companies as Thales Alenia Space, Airbus Defence and Space, ALTER TECHNOLOGY, and a sales representative office for Europe in Italy: the company Dimac RED S.p.a. 
• We are looking for partners to team up for collaboration in the development of measurement instruments for proposed applications as well as companies using not only industrial, including automotive and special purpose microcircuits, but rad-hard microelectronics components for their space payloads also.

entityDescription:
Created to support a more efficient and affordable wireless connectivity, ANYFIELDS developed a new kind of antenna testing tools.
Our EMBox and EMCam use an unique multi patented technology of infrared thermography born at French ONERA lab to measure and visualize in high definition the radiation of all antennas in one click for an instant performance diagnostic.
Accessible, agile and efficient, ANYFIELDS solutions will enable the next wireless innovations, reduce development times and improve industrial processes in strategic fast-growing mobile industries from space to telecom, transportation, drones, IOT&hellip;

VOLTA pioneers a groundbreaking technology enabling ZERO-VOLUME ENERGY STORAGE: Volta Structural Batteries (VSB). Our state-of-the-art multifunctional batteries serve as structural frames for spacecraft, aircrafts and trucks and virtually any transport vehicles, seamlessly integrating energy storage capabilities with their revolutionary architecture and constituent materials. VSB maximizes storable energy, power and, consequently, range within a given system without compromising the mass or volume required for passengers or cargo transport.
This groundbreaking advancement allows spacecraft ranging from 3U CubeSats to large 500+ Kg platforms to allocate 80% to 100% of the original battery pack volume to additional payload, resulting in a 40% reduction in the original battery pack mass and a 2X to 5X increase in available power.

Volta's architecture incorporates state of the art sodium-ion chemistry, the combination of this chemistry with the innovative design results in a highly advanced product with market competitive features such as:
&middot; Higher overall system energy density;
&middot; Fast charging: full charge in less than 15 minutes;
&middot; High power density: maximum power output for demanding applications;
&middot; High cycling and very long battery life, comparable with that of the systems in which it is integrated;
&middot; High mechanical strength and stiffness: properties typical of advanced sandwich composites;
&middot; High safety: robust safety features, even in cases of severe damage.
&middot; High customization: panels of different shapes, sizes and thicknesses can be made according to mechanical and electrochemical requirements, and different materials can also be used for the outer layers, such as high-performance composite materials for aerospace applications or metal and plastic materials for more low-cost applications. 
Volta's solution is also engineered to be produced on a large scale at low cost due to the possibility of using existing production techniques and abundant materials, and with a manageable supply chain even at the national/European level.

ARPAV is a public body founded in 1996. The goal of the Agency is to control and preserve the environment in order to help the identification and elimination of risks to humans and to the environment. Its principal activities are:

&bull; Controlling of the environment including sources of pollution (e.g. industrial emissions, waste, radiation); 
